ervent persuasion to join Hades Soft as the Chief Graphic Artist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a talented graphic artist, and her sense is among the best in the industry."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her coloring technique is so unique that others cannot emulate it, and has the weakness that it's \"beautiful but not suited to mass-production.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She herself is quite inarticulate, hopeless at teaching, and ends up being saddled with doing the work herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As she's gloomy and does things her own way, it ends up causing complications."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's the shy type, but likes to be fawned on like a cat by someone she likes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With the help of her massive breasts, she teases the protagonist."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98890"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef8398bc15532bc16f72e50a09cd68693fe0ae85749e0fc9a292eda182c6bfae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3f82634e0aba37e58c9146506682d34a0e94df8247ca9deda2b414ed7fb647b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小波 すず","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88704","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c98891","characterName":"椎馬 さやか","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c98891"},"originalCharacterName":"椎馬 さやか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","v